# Demo-only client-side gate. NOT security: the hash is embedded in the public bundle.
# Generate it locally with `npm run set-access-password` (writes .env.local, ignored by Git),
# or set it in Vercel > Project Settings > Environment Variables. Never commit a real value.
# Without a valid 64-character hex hash the app does not let anyone in.
# The same value may be named ACCESS_PASSWORD_HASH (for hosts that do not accept the VITE_ prefix).
VITE_ACCESS_PASSWORD_HASH=
